3696
02:15:24,073 --> 02:15:26,083
(Renan)

3697
02:15:26,243 --> 02:15:28,582
(Last Stage: 24H's 3 Choreographers: Renan)

3698
02:15:28,583 --> 02:15:31,183
My mind just went blank at that moment.

3699
02:15:31,313 --> 02:15:33,383
As for Renan,

3700
02:15:33,623 --> 02:15:36,692
