3702
02:15:38,123 --> 02:15:40,662
(During Renan's center part shooting)

3703
02:15:40,663 --> 02:15:42,862
(I think Renan is off beat now.)

3704
02:15:42,863 --> 02:15:46,262
She kept going off beat.

3705
02:15:46,263 --> 02:15:48,832
Renan's are the ones that...

3706
02:15:48,833 --> 02:15:52,003
I remember the least from the video.

3707
02:15:52,173 --> 02:15:56,643
She lacked confidence in the group choreography.

3708
02:15:57,013 --> 02:16:00,442
I wish her facial expressions had been more visible.

3709
02:16:00,443 --> 02:16:03,353
I think it's more about who embodies...

3710
02:16:03,583 --> 02:16:07,022
and understood the energy that's meant for this video...

3711
02:16:07,023 --> 02:16:09,193
the most and the least.

3712
02:16:09,323 --> 02:16:11,123
You know, and finding the..

3713
02:16:11,423 --> 02:16:14,523
It's solely just that in this moment.

3714
02:16:15,023 --> 02:16:17,463
I kept thinking, "No way."

3715
02:16:18,163 --> 02:16:19,733
I'll hate them forever.

3716
02:16:20,103 --> 02:16:22,473
The Fight Judges had high praise...

3717
02:16:22,573 --> 02:16:24,813
