3718
02:16:25,003 --> 02:16:27,673
showcased in the film.

3719
02:16:27,773 --> 02:16:31,142
NaiN was the one who stood out to me.

3720
02:16:31,143 --> 02:16:33,242
When she took center,

3721
02:16:33,243 --> 02:16:36,612
