3728
02:16:48,693 --> 02:16:50,832
- That's right. - Simeez, who was in the heels.

3729
02:16:50,833 --> 02:16:51,833
Yes.

3730
02:16:51,834 --> 02:16:53,603
I was really drawn...

3731
02:16:53,733 --> 02:16:55,232
