3732
02:16:55,233 --> 02:16:58,273
This is her moment, her section, her part.

3733
02:16:58,473 --> 02:17:02,072
BADA has incredible impact as well.

3734
02:17:02,073 --> 02:17:03,172
You can always count on BADA.

3735
02:17:03,173 --> 02:17:07,082
I think she's incredibly good at expressing herself.

3736
02:17:07,083 --> 02:17:09,452
The fact that you can instantly tell,

3737
02:17:09,453 --> 02:17:11,852
"That's BADA," the moment her scene comes on...

3738
02:17:11,853 --> 02:17:14,283
